    "name": "Mushroom Kid's Big Grass Sword",
    "steam_appid": 2734360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.poster.avif?t=1749565324\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.webm?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.mp4?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Kid's Big Grass Sword</strong> is a narrative, physics-based, precision platformer that follows <strong>Mica</strong>, a little mushroom, on a journey to rescue their village after the residents are captured by a gigantic bird. Meet Grandmashroom as she leads Mica to a mysterious temple to claim the Blade of Grass: a powerful weapon with the ability to pull Mica up ledges and over dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.poster.avif?t=1749565324\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.webm?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.mp4?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blade of Grass</strong> is a unique weapon that <strong>can be rotated at any angle the player desires</strong>, allowing Mica to be pulled over obstacles. Combining this with Mica's jumping and gliding abilities creates a platforming experience like no other. Mica must time his jumps and angle the blade to overcome challenges and traverse a mystical world, meeting several wacky mushrooms and growing the sword to comical lengths along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Blade of Grass!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a unique move-set!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet funny characters throughout your journey!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushrooms... lots of mushrooms...</strong>\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.poster.avif?t=1749565324\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.webm?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.mp4?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Kid's Big Grass Sword</strong> is a narrative, physics-based, precision platformer that follows <strong>Mica</strong>, a little mushroom, on a journey to rescue their village after the residents are captured by a gigantic bird. Meet Grandmashroom as she leads Mica to a mysterious temple to claim the Blade of Grass: a powerful weapon with the ability to pull Mica up ledges and over dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.poster.avif?t=1749565324\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.webm?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.mp4?t=1749565324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blade of Grass</strong> is a unique weapon that <strong>can be rotated at any angle the player desires</strong>, allowing Mica to be pulled over obstacles. Combining this with Mica's jumping and gliding abilities creates a platforming experience like no other. Mica must time his jumps and angle the blade to overcome challenges and traverse a mystical world, meeting several wacky mushrooms and growing the sword to comical lengths along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Blade of Grass!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a unique move-set!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet funny characters throughout your journey!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushrooms... lots of mushrooms...</strong>\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as a mushroom on a quest to save their village! Meet wacky characters and wield the Blade of Grass: a magical sword you can use to scale walls and swing around danger. Watch as it grows to comical lengths and stop the bird that captured the mushroom people! \ud83c\udf44\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f",
